# Per-project devwrite settings. Sourced by devwrite, so plain shell.

# MODEL=qwen2.5-coder:7b        smaller/faster, or whatever the endpoint has

# Where the model runs. Default is this machine. Point it at a LAN address to use a
# box with more memory — the serving side needs OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0:11434 ollama serve,
# because ollama binds loopback only.
# ENDPOINT=192.168.1.18:11434

# TIMEOUT=600                   a cold load over a LAN can be slow
# API_KEY=...                   only if the endpoint sits behind an authenticating proxy
